# Four Seven Tech — F7777techMods
# Excluir datos locales / privacidad antes de cualquier publicación.

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.*

# --- IDE / SO ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Datos locales del gestor (NO publicar) ---
data/**
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md

# --- Capturas de validación ---
_s*_captures/
**/_captures/

# --- Informes internos con rutas de máquina ---
# Públicos permitidos: S21, S23, S24_PREPUBLICACION
INFORME_S0*.md
INFORME_S1*.md
INFORME_S2*.md
!INFORME_S21.md
!INFORME_S23.md
!INFORME_S24_PREPUBLICACION.md
INFORME_UI_*.md
HANDOFF_*.md

# --- Legacy scripts locales ---
legacy/**

# --- Cachés / temporales / sandboxes ---
*.log
.tmp/
.temp/
**/_s16_indep_sandbox*/
**/_no_destination/
**/sandbox_extract/
**/own_archive_demo/
**/_tmp*/
**/tmp_sgm*/

# --- Secretos ---
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*credentials*
*token*
secrets/

# --- Empaquetado / builds / release binaria (artefactos fuera del código) ---
dist/
build/
release/
releases/
*.spec.bak
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
!docs/**/*.md

# --- Mods / contenido de juegos ---
**/*.pak
**/*.utoc
**/*.ucas
**/~mods/

# --- Cursor / agentes (local) ---
.cursor/projects/
agent-transcripts/
agent-tools/
